{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a740f60238f1f218f68066d94597661c.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a740f60238f1f218f68066d94597661c.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/a740f60238f1f218f68066d94597661c.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos &amp; Co.</strong>\u2019s deal of a lifetime: the thrilling opportunity to own a convenient store franchise, along with corporate oversight and support <i>(because who doesn't love being watched?</i>)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The twist...\u00a0</strong>the enchantment to create your goods permeates through your shop and sparks your devices to life! They\u2019ll cause mayhem, unless you put their quirks to good use by befriending them.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/e979a4d7f124653898886624cf58e766.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/e979a4d7f124653898886624cf58e766.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/e979a4d7f124653898886624cf58e766.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To succeed:</strong> plan your week meticulously, craft quality items for customers, sell lot of them for profit, and invest wisely. Crucially, always maintain corporate standards or else: <strong>start over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/6bb6401d3c2b1b574213ebe7ad989ce4.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=614 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/6bb6401d3c2b1b574213ebe7ad989ce4.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/6bb6401d3c2b1b574213ebe7ad989ce4.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the\u00a0<strong>craziest \u201cconvenient\u201d store</strong>, a wonder of automation, a mass production factory or specialize into niche goods. Whatever you sell, <strong>Chaos &amp; Co.</strong> <strong>will set you up.\u00a0</strong><i>(Literally!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/d178ad30aeb049eb30a70cf7f8f78477.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/d178ad30aeb049eb30a70cf7f8f78477.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/d178ad30aeb049eb30a70cf7f8f78477.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb that corporate ladder, my friend! The higher you go, the <strong>better</strong>, <strong>faster</strong>, and more <strong>bank-breaking</strong> your options become:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+</strong> Awesome <strong>item</strong> recipes to delight your customers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+</strong> <strong>Contraptions</strong>, each with a <strong>quirky</strong> personality and <strong>upgrades</strong> that'll make your store so powerful, it might just come to life!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>75+</strong> <strong>Chaos Pins</strong> to boost your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ C&amp;Co Coupons\u00a0</strong>to pick daily to help during upcoming shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+</strong>\u00a0<strong>TGIF</strong>: End of week Challenges to complete for the ultimate corporate recognition! <i>(or disappointment...)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/fb0186731ebd5b5c5556cd34a66fdf5f.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/fb0186731ebd5b5c5556cd34a66fdf5f.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/fb0186731ebd5b5c5556cd34a66fdf5f.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s no time for vacations! At night, set up your shop and <strong>move appliances around</strong> to build an optimal crafting and shopping experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either be a penny-pincher saving for a rainy day, or break the bank every night to get a lucky roll with C&amp;Co.'s\u00a0supplier:<strong> Parcella the Caterpillar.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/739da6ba2a6f835e56d4432b7b84a55e.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/739da6ba2a6f835e56d4432b7b84a55e.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/739da6ba2a6f835e56d4432b7b84a55e.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag <strong>up to four &quot;friends&quot;</strong> along in co-op mode or play solo.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clerk\u2019s customization: Go wild! Pick some <strong>ridiculous hairstyles</strong>, and pick from, like, too many colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your store\u2019s vibe with <strong>vibrant paint and dazzling lighting</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the <strong>strangest of places</strong> with Chaos &amp; Co.\u2019s portal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of store layouts</strong> to experience each run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/39789e285187227d9fe19e384e1d2b54.poster.avif?t=1759771075\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/39789e285187227d9fe19e384e1d2b54.webm?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/extras/39789e285187227d9fe19e384e1d2b54.mp4?t=1759771075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3454860?t=1759771075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454860/c65f787053fff3b701e0c48b751b1f0e468f45de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759771075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c